      "text": "Pharaoh … pursued after the children of Israel, Ex. 14:8. ye shall flee when none pursueth you, Lev. 26:17. Lest the avenger of the blood pursue the slayer, Deut. 19:6 (Josh. 20:5). god; either he is talking, or he is pursuing, 1 Kgs. 18:27. pursued after the king, 2 Kgs. 25:5 (Jer. 52:8). seek peace, and pursue it, Ps. 34:14. he that pursueth evil pursueth it to his own death, Prov. 11:19. wicked flee when no man pursueth, Prov. 28:1.",
